put('sports.html','Sports catalogue','Fourteen sand sport and training formats with mixed beach volleyball at the heart.',
    hero('THE SPORTING HEART','The sand is an arena, not one sport.','Mixed beach volleyball anchors a full catalogue. Each club can bring its own sport, coaches and people to a different surface, with space and schedule decisions made together.','hero-sports.webp')+
    section('GLOBAL SCALE','A worldwide sport with a visible Australian stage','FIVB reports 179 national federations represented in beach volleyball rankings. Its 2025 World Championships in Adelaide assembled 96 teams from 40 nations. At Paris 2024, beach volleyball drew nearly 450,000 spectators. These are sport and event figures, not a forecast for Straddie.',cards([
      ('179 FEDERATIONS','Beach rankings','National federations represented in FIVB beach volleyball rankings in 2026.','','https://www.fivb.com/global-growth-and-strategic-progress-take-centre-stage-on-day-one-of-40th-fivb-world-congress/'),
      ('96 TEAMS · 40 NATIONS','Adelaide 2025','Australia hosted a major beach volleyball world championship with international depth.','','https://en.volleyballworld.com/news/match-schedule-released-for-2025-fivb-beach-volleyball-world-championships-in-adelaide'),
      ('NEARLY 450,000','Paris 2024 crowd','Olympic beach volleyball spectator attendance reported by the IOC.','','https://www.olympics.com/ioc/news/paris-2024-record-breaking-olympic-games-on-and-off-the-field')]),'sunny')+
    section('OTHER GLOBAL SIGNALS','A family of sports with momentum','The NFL reports more than 20 million flag players in over 100 countries. ICC says its flexible criiio cricket programme reached one million players. FIFA staged a 16-nation Beach Soccer World Cup in 2025. Dakar 2026 includes beach handball at the Youth Olympic Games. These describe different formats and programmes, not equivalent beach participation totals.',cards([
      ('FLAG','20 million players','NFL estimate across more than 100 countries.','','https://media.nfl.com/news-and-releases/corporate-communications/nfl-brings-flag-football-to-schools-across-australia-with-nation'),
      ('CRICKET','One million reached','ICC criiio flexible-format milestone.','','https://www.icc-cricket.com/criiio/about'),
      ('BEACH SOCCER','16 nations','FIFA Beach Soccer World Cup 2025 field.','','https://www.fifa.com/en/tournaments/mens/beachsoccerworldcup/seychelles-2025'),
      ('BEACH HANDBALL','Youth Olympics','Dakar 2026 programme.','','https://www.olympics.com/ioc/dakar-2026')],'four'))+
    section('SPORTS CATALOGUE','Fourteen ways to play','These are programme proposals, not confirmed activities. Select formats with clubs and participants, then fit fields and equipment to the site.',cards([(icon,title,copy,'', '/flag-football.html' if title=='Flag football' else '/sport-'+__import__('re').sub(r'[^a-z0-9]+','-',title.lower()).strip('-')+'.html') for icon,title,copy in sports],'four'),'alt')+
    section('CROSSOVER MODEL','Existing clubs gain another surface','Rugby league, cricket, football, tennis, bowls, surfing and other island clubs already have histories and members. Sandy Sports can host joint events and complementary training without absorbing them. Agreements would spell out coaching, insurance, equipment, safeguarding, schedules and recognition.','<div class="link-row"><a class="button coral" href="/space-planner.html">Try the space planner</a><a class="button outline" href="/flag-football.html">Flag football pathway</a></div>')+
    section('OLYMPIC DECADE','World-class opportunity, island character','Training camps, mixed competitions, school-to-club pathways and sand sport expos can connect local participation to the wider Brisbane 2032 horizon. The 2032 sport programme is not yet final.','','sunny'))

put('flag-football.html','Flag football','A dedicated flag football proposal connecting Minjerribah with Gold Coast development and Brisbane 2032 ambition.',
    hero('A BIG CROSS-CODE OPPORTUNITY','Flag football belongs in the main event.',"The NFL's Australia and New Zealand office and APAC academy are on the Gold Coast. Australian and US governing bodies are developing flag football, which makes its Olympic debut in Los Angeles 2028. Straddie could add an island training and cultural exchange opportunity.",'flag-football-concept.webp')+
    section('GROWTH NUMBERS','More than a passing trend','The NFL reports more than 20 million flag football players in over 100 countries. Its Australian school competitions reached more than 500 schools and close to 100,000 students by April 2026. These are the NFL’s programme estimates, not Sandy Sports participation.', '<div class="link-row"><a class="button outline" href="https://media.nfl.com/news-and-releases/corporate-communications/nfl-brings-flag-football-to-schools-across-australia-with-nation">Read the NFL release</a></div>','sunny')+
    section('GOLD COAST CONNECTION','A regional pathway worth talking to','The Gold Coast academy facilities are intended to support flag football. NFL and American Football Australia announced a national Sporting Schools partnership in 2026. Sandy Sports could invite coaches and schools to co-design an island programme; no partnership is in place.',cards([
      ('PLAY','Mixed social flag','Non-contact introduction, mixed teams, youth sessions and visiting-club days with qualified leaders.','flag-football-concept.webp',''),
      ('TRAIN','Sand conditioning crossover','Footwork and conditioning where coaches find it useful. A competition field needs separate dimensional checks.','flag-football-concept.webp',''),
      ('EXPO','2032 cultures and sport','An island expo could connect flag and volleyball with food, film and multicultural exchange.','hero-markets.webp','')]),'alt')+
    section('STATUS CHECK','Los Angeles is confirmed. Brisbane is an ambition.','The IOC says the Brisbane 2032 programme will be finalised in April 2027. Flag football’s 2032 inclusion cannot be assumed. The NFL and AFA have publicly described their aspirations.','<div class="link-row"><a class="button outline" href="https://media.nfl.com/news-and-releases/international/national-football-league-to-open-nfl-academy-on-australia-s-gold">NFL Gold Coast academy</a><a class="button outline" href="https://media.nfl.com/news-and-releases/international/national-football-league-and-american-football-australia-partner">NFL/AFA schools partnership</a><a class="button outline" href="https://www.olympics.com/ioc/news/brisbane-2032-sports-programme-to-be-finalised-at-147th-ioc-session-in-april-2027">IOC update</a></div>','sunny'))

