put('assets.html','Asset wish list','A shared asset register for courts, clubhouses, lighting, LED screens, media and events.',
    hero('SHARED EQUIPMENT, SERIOUS CAPABILITY','A wish list built for an island network.','Think in systems: what is fixed at a venue, what moves between towns, what can be lent to existing clubs, and what could earn a return through managed hire.','hero-funding.webp')+
    section('ASSET FAMILIES','The full equipment picture','Every item needs an owner, custodian, storage, maintenance, lifespan, operating budget and permissions. The register below is a proposal list without quoted prices or purchase commitments.',cards([(kind,title,copy,'','') for kind,title,copy in assets],'four'),'alt')+
    section('SCREEN ECONOMY','One screen system, several uses','A permanent screen could give the principal venue year-round identity. Segmentable LED panels may serve smaller clubhouses, pop-up film nights, conferences or supervised external hire. The financial model must distinguish capital, staff, transport, power, insurance, content rights, repair and replacement.', '<div class="link-row"><a class="button coral" href="/film-club.html">Film and media club</a><a class="button outline" href="/grants.html">Funding mix</a></div>','sunny')+
    section('WORKING WISH LIST','Prioritise concrete wishes','Review the starter wishes, match them to researched funding leads, and add an item in your browser. No purchase or pledge is recorded.', '<div id="working-wishes"><div id="asset-workspace"></div></div>',''),'club-tools.js')

put('programme.html','Events and cultural programme','Sand sports, cinema, markets, festivals and multicultural exchange as one island calendar.',
    hero('THE ISLAND CALENDAR','Play hard. Make a whole day of it.','A shared calendar can connect leagues, cross-code days, training camps, film screenings, markets and cultural festivals. Every event has its own organiser and permission path.','hero-markets.webp')+
    section('PROPOSED PROGRAMME','Different reasons to come together','Sport is the daily core. Creative and market layers can extend the visit, build local skills and offer more people a way into the club.',cards([
      ('SPORT','Mixed sand leagues','Volleyball, flag, cricket, football and crossover days across the three towns.','hero-sports.webp','/sports.html'),
      ('SCREEN','Outdoor cinema','Local shorts, sport stories, documentary nights and a film club programme.','hero-film.webp','/film-club.html'),
      ('MARKETS','Makers and food','Island enterprise, food, craft and multicultural exchange alongside major play days.','hero-markets.webp',''),
      ('FESTIVAL','Sand sport expo','Invitational sport with music, workshops, screens and visiting communities.','hero-home.webp',''),
      ('YOUTH','Skills transfer','Coaching, officiating, media production, event work and practical mentoring.','hero-youth-elders.webp',''),
      ('COUNTRY','Cultural programmes','First Nations-led work through invitation and agreements, alongside other island creative communities.','hero-trust.webp','')]))+
    section('EVENT DESK','Plan with the right people','A run sheet should connect the sport lead, venue manager, cultural lead, film club, suppliers, safety team and existing clubs. The demo committee area includes a sample event desk.', '<div class="link-row"><a class="button coral" href="/committee.html">Explore event desk</a><a class="button outline" href="https://auraofintelligence.github.io/quandamooka-country-events-engine/">Events engine reference</a></div>','sunny'))

put('film-club.html','Film and media club','A distinct film club inside Sandy Sports for screenings, festivals, skill transfer and live production.',
    hero('SANDY SPORTS FILM CLUB','A second kind of team on the island.','The film club can programme outdoor cinema, festivals and a media hub while training local makers. It can film games, produce stories and create live event coverage with the sporting clubs, under the right permissions.','hero-film.webp')+
    section('FILM CLUB DESKS','Programme, produce, teach, screen','Keep a distinct film club committee or working group within the wider club, with its own editorial decisions, rights register, crew training and equipment bookings.',cards([
      ('PROGRAMME','Film festivals and cinema','Local shorts, visiting work, documentary, youth and multicultural screenings with creator permissions.','hero-film.webp','https://auraofintelligence.github.io/quandamooka-film-festival/'),
      ('MEDIA HUB','Production and skill transfer','Camera, editing, commentary, captioning, graphics, livestream and event operations taught through real projects.','hero-trust.webp','https://auraofintelligence.github.io/minjerribah-screen-media-network/network/'),
      ('LIVE','Sport broadcasts','Potential live coverage of volleyball, flag, cricket, AFL and rugby league club crossovers, with rights, safeguarding, bandwidth and editorial responsibility agreed first.','hero-sports.webp','')]),'alt')+
    section('DISPLAY SYSTEM','Permanent spectacle, portable utility','A fixed outdoor LED screen could anchor a main venue. Mobile, segmentable panels could become smaller club screens and a managed hire fleet. The film club and asset custodian would coordinate rigging, transport, insurance, rights and maintenance.', '<div class="link-row"><a class="button coral" href="/assets.html">Screen asset plan</a><a class="button outline" href="/programme.html">Island programme</a></div>')+
    section('CULTURAL LEADERSHIP','Make space for stories on their own terms','The separate Quandamooka Film Festival proposal and Minjerribah Screen Media Network provide connected ideas. Indigenous stories, names, imagery and community events require the relevant people to lead and approve their own work. No cultural endorsement is implied.', '', 'sunny'))

